# Morning Garden Colour Rules

**Core rule**: every colour choice must feel like "6 AM in a quiet garden — warm, grounded, alive, never loud."

## NEVER do this

```dart
// ❌ Raw hex
color: Color(0xFF4CAF50)

// ❌ Bare Material colour
color: Colors.green

// ❌ seedGold as text (fails WCAG AA 4.5:1)
style: TextStyle(color: AppColors.seedGold)
```

## ALWAYS use AppColors tokens

| Purpose | Token | Hex |
|---|---|---|
| Page background | `AppColors.skyDecoration(isDark: isDark)` | gradient |
| Screen scaffold bg | `colorScheme.surface` | — |
| Content card | `AppColors.cloudDecoration(isDark: isDark)` | — |
| Primary CTA / FAB | `colorScheme.primary` | #4A7A5A |
| Bottom nav bg | `AppColors.forestDeep` | #3B2D20 |
| Active nav icon | `AppColors.sproutGreen` | #4A7A5A |
| Coin / badge icon fill | `AppColors.seedGold` | #C48B3C |
| Amber / reward **text** | `AppColors.honeyText` | #7A5520 ✅ WCAG AA |
| Chips / selected rows bg | `AppColors.sageContainer` | #DCF0E4 |
| Badge / reward container | `AppColors.seedChampagne` | #FDF3E3 |
| Mood / journal / affirmations | `AppColors.lavenderDew` | #7B74A8 |
| Lavender container | `AppColors.lavenderContainer` | #EEEDF8 |
| Light card surface | `AppColors.cloudWhite` | #FFFFFF |
| Dark card surface | `AppColors.cloudDark` | #1F2B22 |
| Error states | `colorScheme.error` | — |

## Dark mode detection (required when using decorations)

```dart
final isDark = Theme.of(context).brightness == Brightness.dark;
// then:
decoration: AppColors.skyDecoration(isDark: isDark),
decoration: AppColors.cloudDecoration(isDark: isDark),
```

## Imports

```dart
import '../utils/app_colors.dart'; // adjust relative depth
```
